# The bundled demo needs no environment variables.
#
# Live sessions (connect your own app) need shared storage on serverless hosts such as Vercel,
# because function instances don't share memory. Locally and on a single Node server, an
# in-memory store is used automatically and these can stay unset.
#
# Upstash Redis REST credentials (Vercel Marketplace → Upstash also sets KV_REST_API_URL / KV_REST_API_TOKEN,
# which are read as a fallback):
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
